   "footer_signals": "",
   "injection_flags": [],
   "text": "Careers at Acme Ledger\nOpen role 1: Senior Engineer position on the platform team, remote friendly across time zones.\nOpen role 2: Senior Engineer position on the platform team, remote friendly across time zones.\nOpen role 3: Senior Engineer position on the platform team, remote friendly across time zones.\nOpen role 4: Senior Engineer position on the platform team, remote friendly across time zones.\nOpen role 5: Senior Engineer position on the platform team, remote friendly across time zones.",
