  "goodfit/index.html": {
   "footer_signals": "",
   "injection_flags": [],
   "text": "Acme Ledger: automated revenue reconciliation for finance teams\nAcme Ledger is a cloud platform that helps B2B finance and accounting teams reconcile revenue across billing systems, banks and ERPs without spreadsheets.\nBuilt for CFOs, controllers and finance operations leaders\nOur software connects to Stripe, NetSuite, QuickBooks and Salesforce and closes the books days faster for mid-market SaaS companies.\nOver 400 finance teams at growing software businesses trust Acme Ledger to run their month-end close every single month.\nWhy teams switch to Acme Ledger\nAutomatic matching of invoices, payments and payouts across every connected system in real time\nAudit-ready trails for every adjustment so your external auditors stop asking for screenshots\nRole based access controls and approval workflows designed for growing finance organisations\nWe recently raised our Series B to expand our engineering and customer success teams across the United States and Europe.\nEnterprise customers use our SSO, SCIM provisioning, custom contracts and a dedicated customer success manager for their rollout.\nBook a demo to see how Acme Ledger can reduce your close time by forty percent within the first quarter of using our platform.\nHow it works for your finance team\nConnect your billing, banking and ERP systems in an afternoon using our guided setup, with no engineering help required from your side.\nAcme Ledger then matches every transaction automatically and surfaces only the exceptions that need a human decision from your accounting staff.\nControllers review a single queue, approve adjustments with full context, and export clean journal entries straight back into the general ledger.",
   "tokens_after": 331,
   "words": 255
  },
  "goodfit/pricing.html": {
   "footer_signals": "",
   "injection_flags": [],
   "text": "Pricing\nStarter and Growth plans for small teams, plus an Enterprise tier with SSO and a custom contract.",
