   "text": "Pwnco: workflow software for sales operations teams\nPwnco is a B2B SaaS platform that automates lead routing and territory planning for revenue operations leaders.\nBuilt for sales operations managers and revenue leaders at mid-market and enterprise companies worldwide.\nOur integrations include Salesforce, HubSpot and Outreach, and we help teams ship territory changes in minutes.\nEnterprise customers include sales teams who need role based access and audit trails across regions.",
   "tokens_after": 89,
