   "footer_signals": "",
   "injection_flags": [],
   "text": "Nimbus Metrics: product analytics for B2B software companies\nNimbus Metrics is a cloud analytics platform that shows product managers how business customers use their software.\nBuilt for product leaders and growth teams at B2B SaaS companies who need to understand adoption by account.\nFeatures\nAccount level dashboards that roll up usage across every seat inside a customer organisation\nFunnels, retention and cohort analysis tuned for sales-led software products and trials\nWarehouse sync to Snowflake and BigQuery so analysts can query raw events directly\nEnterprise plans include SSO, audit logs, and a dedicated support engineer for onboarding your team.\nWe are backed by a seed round led by top investors and hiring across engineering and go to market teams.\nRequest a demo to see Nimbus Metrics on your own product data within one day of connecting your sources.\nOur customers include fast growing software companies in fintech, healthcare, developer tools and cybersecurity.\nTeams switch to Nimbus Metrics from legacy tools to cut dashboard maintenance and answer questions in seconds.",
